<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">21062026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Israeli strikes killed at least sixteen people in southern Lebanon, just hours after a ceasefire signed in the Islamabad deal was meant to take hold.</s> <s>That agreement explicitly covered Lebanon, yet an Israeli cabinet minister posted the words burn Lebanon on X, and the platform left the message live.</s> <s>In response, Iran declared the Strait of Hormuz closed — tying any reopening to a halt in the strikes.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Israeli strikes killed eleven people in Gaza, among them two girls — Zina, who was four, and Lana, who was fourteen.</s> <s>Hours later a strike on the Bureij camp killed Al Jazeera cameraman Ahmed Wishah, whose own brother was killed in an Israeli strike back in April.</s> <s>Gaza's health ministry now counts more than a thousand people killed since October's ceasefire was supposed to hold.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Nigeria, Governor Biodun Oyebanji became the first sitting leader of Ekiti state ever to win re-election, polling nearly eight times his closest rival.</s> <s>Ekiti has a long history of unseating its incumbents, so the result breaks a pattern decades in the making.</s> <s>But a companion report found sixty-six polling-unit results were never uploaded to the electoral commission's transparency portal, leaving a declared clean win shadowed by missing paperwork.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A court in Quetta sentenced the father and uncle of fourteen-year-old Hira Anwar to life in prison for her murder.</s> <s>The Pakistani-American girl was shot in January last year, and her father filed a false report blaming unknown gunmen before forensics implicated him.</s> <s>A life term, rather than acquittal, signals that Pakistani courts increasingly treat honor as no defense — though the family's appeal window remains open.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Shakira Galíndez, a Venezuelan trans woman who fled persecution to seek asylum in the United States, was detained by immigration agents at her own hearing.</s> <s>She's been held in a men's facility since September, exposed to the very danger she escaped, and now faces deportation back to Venezuela.</s> <s>It is a system that recognized her risk on paper, then recreated that risk in custody.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Edinburgh, five Muslims were attacked, and Scottish counterterrorism officers have taken charge of the investigation.</s> <s>Britain rarely classifies anti-Muslim violence as terrorism, which makes the designation itself significant.</s> <s>A thirty-six-year-old man is in custody without charge as police weigh whether a terrorism motive applies.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A Spanish judge has ordered the wife of Prime Minister Pedro Sánchez to stand trial on charges of embezzlement and influence peddling.</s> <s>Using Spain's investigating-magistrate system, Judge Peinado required Begoña Gómez to appear in court every two weeks.</s> <s>No trial date is set, and Sánchez, who faces elections within the year, calls the case politically driven.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>More than two point two million students across India re-sat the national medical entrance exam, after a paper leak forced an unprecedented national do-over.</s> <s>The testing agency cancelled the original exam amid protests and demands for the education minister's resignation.</s> <s>Because a single integrity failure can reset the careers of millions, the leak has become a story about who controls access to India's medical profession.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A study of China's capital markets found that when regulators send a comment letter querying a company's bonds, the firm's cost of equity rises.</s> <s>That query signals hidden default risk which stock investors hadn't priced in, turning a routine disclosure into a quiet warning.</s> <s>It's a reminder that transparency, meant to protect investors, can itself carry a price.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Iran and Kazakhstan met in Aktau to discuss new transit routes across the Caspian Sea.</s> <s>One country sits under Western sanctions, the other is landlocked, and the Caspian is their shared exit from shipping lanes the West controls.</s> <s>No volumes or timelines were agreed, but the meeting sketches a quiet map around Western chokepoints.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>France banned alcohol at parts of its national Fête de la Musique as a record heatwave pushed temperatures toward forty-one degrees Celsius and triggered red alerts across thirty-five departments.</s> <s>Drinking deepens dehydration, sharply raising the risk of fatal heat stroke in dense outdoor crowds.</s> <s>It's a small rule that shows how warming summers are reshaping even a country's most ordinary public traditions.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>An AI-driven model of soybeans grown under elevated carbon dioxide found they yield fifty percent more beans, but of markedly lower nutritional quality.</s> <s>The extra carbon dioxide inflates carbohydrate while displacing protein in the world's key livestock feed and a leading human protein source.</s> <s>Climate change, it turns out, can make our food more abundant and less nourishing at the very same time.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Colombia's ban on new oil exploration goes to the ballot this Sunday.</s> <s>The country was the first major producer to halt new drilling, but the election frontrunner has pledged to reverse that moratorium if he wins.</s> <s>Whether a nation can truly choose to leave its oil in the ground may now hinge on a single vote.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>When a meteor streaks overhead, its boom can arrive minutes after the flash.</s> <s>Travelling faster than sound, it compresses the air in front of it into a shock wave carrying hundreds of tons of TNT-equivalent energy.</s> <s>Yet no ground-sensor network reliably detects these small airbursts before they reach low altitude.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Researchers in Germany trained models to detect stress from raw eye-tracking signals in real-world conditions, without the lab calibration that once blocked consumer use.</s> <s>Their system reads strain directly from how the eyes move, the exact barrier that had kept it out of everyday devices.</s> <s>The open question is who would receive that data — an insurer, an employer, an advertiser — because no rule yet governs it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Physicists have proposed that gravastars could replace what we now call black holes — horizonless compact objects that sidestep the singularity at a black hole's core.</s> <s>The idea would resolve the information-loss paradox that has long troubled general relativity.</s> <s>Gravitational-wave echoes and shadow imaging might soon tell the two apart, God willing.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>